{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SK3j2Dn17JyDxvsip9VJNa","type":"tool_result","content":"1:# Olympiyikes!\n14:## 0. Read this first (ground rules for the builders)\n36:### 0.1 Fetch what you build on (once, inside the dev folder)\n56:## 1. The game\n58:### 1.1 Pitch\n70:### 1.2 Pillars\n80:### 1.3 Genre and perspective (decisions)\n95:### 1.4 Core loop\n102:### 1.5 Modes (main menu, in this order)\n118:## 2. Controls and input (controller-first, keyboard and mouse native)\n120:### 2.1 The action map (custom preset `OLY_KEYS`, replaces the engine presets for the whole game)\n151:### 2.2 Per-event use of the actions\n168:### 2.3 Button prompts and glyphs (a must-build: the pixel font has no ✕ ○ □ △)\n193:### 2.4 Menus\n199:### 2.5 The game's settings (Settings → Game group, via `new E.Game({ menu: { settings: [...] } })`)\n218:## 3. UI and UX (10-foot)\n220:### 3.1 Rules\n239:### 3.2 Screens (all pixel art unless marked HTML)\n272:### 3.3 Touch-only devices\n282:## 4. Architecture\n284:### 4.1 Tech stack\n294:### 4.2 Folder layout\n308:### 4.3 Source files (load order = bundle order)\n336:### 4.4 The game object\n351:### 4.5 Scenes\n365:### 4.6 Engine changes (all marked `// OLY:` in `engine/my-3d2dge.js`; list them on the About screen)\n382:### 4.7 Randomness and determinism\n392:### 4.8 Data model\n408:### 4.9 Bundle\n432:## 5. Shared gameplay systems\n434:### 5.1 The event contract (`O.defEvent`) and the phase runner\n478:### 5.2 Pilots, intents and the autoplayer\n494:### 5.3 Formats\n506:### 5.4 Input widgets (src/12-eventkit.js; each has `update`, `press`/`read` and a 10-foot `draw`)\n521:### 5.5 Hype and YIKES TURBO\n532:### 5.6 CPU rivals and difficulty\n542:### 5.7 Results, qualifying, points, records, medals\n558:### 5.8 Yikes moments\n566:### 5.9 Ghosts\n574:### 5.10 Commentary\n586:### 5.11 Crowd, jumbotron, camera, slow-mo\n598:### 5.12 Laurels\n604:### 5.13 Tuning registry (the dev sliders' data)\n613:### 5.14 Saves\n622:## 6. The twelve events\n631:### 6.1 100m DASH — summer · Glory Stadium · mash\n665:### 6.2 JAVELIN THROW — summer · Glory Stadium infield · mash + angle\n698:### 6.3 50m FREESTYLE (short course) — summer · Splash Palace · rhythm + breath\n729:### 6.4 10m PLATFORM DIVING — summer · Splash Palace · tricks + entry timing\n761:### 6.5 ARCHERY — summer · Bullseye Lawn (seaside) · aim under sway\n788:### 6.6 WEIGHTLIFTING (clean & jerk) — summer · Iron Hall · mash + balance + timing\n814:### 6.7 SKI JUMP (large hill, K-125, HS-140) — winter · Mount Glory Jumping Hill · timing + flight balance\n846:### 6.8 DOWNHILL — winter · \"The Yikes Face\" · steering + tuck + gates\n891:### 6.9 TWO-MAN BOBSLED — winter · Glory Ice Track (dusk) · push + load + banked steering\n915:### 6.10 FIGURE SKATING (free skate) — winter · Glory Ice Palace · rhythm\n946:### 6.11 CURLING (gold medal match) — winter · Glory Curling Club · aim + weight + sweep (physics)\n979:### 6.12 ICE HOCKEY FINAL (2-on-2 + goalies) — winter · Glory Arena · team action\n1008:## 7. Content\n1014:### 7.1 Nations and their star athletes (8 = 8 lanes)\n1069:### 7.2 Venues (levels)\n1088:### 7.3 Story structure (The Games)\n1105:### 7.4 Ceremony scripts\n1143:### 7.5 Records (in-world World Records, seeded into `oly:records`)\n1161:### 7.6 Commentary banks (write ≥ 160 lines in total; samples below set the voice)\n1200:### 7.7 Pictograms, emblem, flags\n1213:### 7.8 Items, power-ups, opponents and hazards\n1226:## 8. Art and animation\n1228:### 8.1 Look (the engine's native style, pushed to its look target)\n1238:### 8.2 Pose layer (`O.Pose`, src/06-pose.js) and the engine's pose hook\n1272:### 8.3 Effects\n1280:### 8.4 Lighting per venue\n1287:### 8.5 The mascot: YIKESY\n1296:## 9. Audio (all in code)\n1298:### 9.1 Music (engine songs `{ bpm, steps: 4, tracks }`, every one original)\n1328:### 9.2 Sound effects (`audio.define`, layered voices; names → recipe)\n1342:### 9.3 Voices: `O.Voice.speak(text, voice)`