eadless); Linux; browser unknown\",\n    \"model\": \"Anthropic, claude-opus-5-5, reasoning effort medium\",\n    \"usage\": \"unknown\"\n  },\n  \"testingFeedback\": [],\n  \"engineFeedback\": [],\n  \"promptFeedback\": [],\n  \"aiHub\": {\n    \"name\": \"Olympiyikes!\",\n    \"tagline\": \"Faster. Higher. Yikes.\",\n    \"description\": \"Twelve over-the-top Summer and Winter events in one wild fortnight: sprint, swim, fly off a ski jump, sweep stones and win the hockey final for your nation, alone or with up to four players.\",\n    \"type\": \"Game\",\n    \"genre\": \"Sports\",\n    \"source\": \"The Olympic Games\",\n    \"series\": \"\",\n    \"players\": \"1–4\",\n    \"controls\": \"Stick/WASD move · □○ or J K mash · ✕/Space act · △/Shift turbo · R2/L hold\",\n    \"tags\": [\"2d\", \"arcade\", \"pixel art\", \"comedy\", \"versus\", \"retro\"]\n  }\n}\n"}}}
