{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Stop hook feedback:\n[Read STAGE.md in the current folder and do what it says (TASK.md describes the game). Done when: the bundled single .html file exists in this folder's root, every feature in TASK.md is implemented with no TODOs, placeholders or stubs, exit-interview.json in this folder's root parses as JSON and answers every field, and your final reply contains the Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections.]: The bundle, the parsing exit-interview.json and the four reply sections are present, but the transcript does not show every TASK.md feature implemented and verified to spec. The last reply itself says the generated music and gibberish voices have not been listened to, and no human has played the game with a pad. The TASK.md feature 'prompts follow the input used last' and the audio requirements are therefore only checked by tests, not by a person. The prompt also carries an unresolved question on the plan-vs-TASK.md point: the plan was followed for the bobsled and dive standards, which TASK.md leaves open, so those are not gaps. The remaining gap is that the 1080p engine settings sheet was still judged 'small' in an earlier screenshot and never re-verified after the last scaling change."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d0d39672-91d7-4659-90e6-59a7cf2c42a6","uuid":"abc0b691-6f33-415d-acb4-56f3c2aa5b50","timestamp":"2026-11-04T16:32:55.059Z","isSynthetic":true}
